{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-staircase-corner-hook","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:staircase-corner-hook","kind":"lemma","title":"Staircase corner hook $h_{\\mathrm{corner}}(\\rho_k) = 2k - 1$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-staircase-partition"],"cites":["references/stanley1999"],"tags":["staircase-partition","hook-length","corner-cell","combinatorial-lemma","ew-residual"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.StaircaseCornerHook.staircase_corner_hook_eq_two_k_sub_one","text":"staircase-corner-hook.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:staircase-corner-hook\"></a><p><em>For every <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k \\geq 1</code>, the corner hook of the staircase partition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\rho_k</code> at cell <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(0, 0)</code> satisfies</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  h_{\\mathrm{corner}}(\\rho_k)\n  \\;=\\; \\mathrm{arm}(0,0) + \\mathrm{leg}(0,0) + 1\n  \\;=\\; 2k - 1.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/staircase-corner-hook.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"13.40.12"}
